    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "3.3",
      "title": "15th century Style Helmets",
      "body": "At the edge of the 15th century, an evolution of previous Bascinets was developed. The great Bascinet encompasses an increased neck protection that makes it very safe. Some extant artifacts are displayed in museums.\n\nMusée de l’Armée, Paris - 1400/1420 - France Musées des Beaux Arts, Dijon - 1400/1420 - France\n\nDoges Palace, Venice - 1380/1390 - Italy",
      "page_from": 7,
